  \href{https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.18647}{arXiv:2402.18647}.

  \item[\textup{[Bog26]}]\label{ref:p38-bogner}
  K. Bogner, ``Robust Logarithmic Lower Bound on Shared-Resource Cost for
